# Enemy composition 1 — the Anchor is the door, the Lobbers are the damage.
# Terrain and placement share one grid, so the board is what it looks like.
#   .  open        #  wall        O  pit        ^  spikes      H  high ground
#   A  Player A deploy slot       B  Player B deploy slot
#   any other letter = an enemy declared by a 'spawn' line below

id: ec-01-shieldwall
number: 301
name: Shieldwall
description: An Anchor stands in the only gate and a second in front of it, while two Lobbers land rocks straight through the wall. Break the door, not the Anchors.

spawn l = Lobber
spawn n = Anchor

roster a: Vanguard, Archer
roster b: Threadcaster, Wardbearer

board:
  .l...l.
  ###n###
  ..^n^..
  ...H...
  .......
  A.....B
  AA...BB
